Package: uofgbacktest
Type: Package
Title: A Causally Rigorous Backtesting Engine for the UofG R Monorepo
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Wyatt", "Au", , "wyatt_au@protonmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small backtesting engine built on the monorepo's data and
    statistics layers. Enforces the methodological rules from the
    backtesting-hygiene vignette in code: signals must be causal
    (look-ahead attempts are rejected), positions are applied with a
    one-period lag, transaction costs are charged per position change,
    and splits are time-based. Depends on 'uofgdata', 'uofgstats' and
    'uofgcore' to demonstrate a multi-level internal dependency chain.
